{"source":"github","project_id":"multilevelmod","target":"tidymodels/multilevelmod","id":"pr/74","ref":74,"title":"added lmerTest ","description":"I have successfully added lmerTest to the package, as I requested in https://github.com/tidymodels/multilevelmod/issues/73. \r\n\r\n```\r\nusethis::use_package('lmerTest', type = \"Suggeasts\", min_version = TRUE)\r\ndevtools::load_all()\r\ndevtools::document()\r\ndevtools::test() # passed\r\ndevtools::install()\r\n\r\nusethis::use_version(push = FALSE) # set to 'dev'\r\n\r\ndevtools::load_all()\r\ndevtools::document()\r\ndevtools::test() # passed\r\ndevtools::install()\r\n```\r\n\r\n","published_at":"2025-02-07T15:28:56Z","url":"https://github.com/tidymodels/multilevelmod/pull/74","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"jkylearmstrong","state":"OPEN"}}
